var DATA={"label": "Troubleshooting Guide Builder - public implementations surve", "lines": ["# Tutorial", "Install:", "```", "npm i```", "x = 'yyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy'  "]};

var issues=[],depth=0;
console.log('Linting '+DATA.lines.length+' lines ('+DATA.label+'):');
DATA.lines.forEach(function(line,i){var n=i+1;
  if(line.length>88)issues.push('line '+n+': exceeds 88 chars ('+line.length+')');
  if(/[ \t]+$/.test(line))issues.push('line '+n+': trailing whitespace');
  for(var c=0;c<line.length;c++){if(line[c]==='{'||line[c]==='('||line[c]==='[')depth++;
    if(line[c]==='}'||line[c]===')'||line[c]===']')depth--;}
  if(depth<0)issues.push('line '+n+': unbalanced closing bracket');});
if(depth>0)issues.push('EOF: '+depth+' unclosed bracket(s)');
if(!issues.length)console.log('CLEAN - no issues found');
else{issues.forEach(function(x){console.log('  ! '+x);});console.log(issues.length+' issue(s)');}
})();

